      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "行动会影响四种常规结局，全部达成后再解锁额外结局",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "Four endings (and one bonus ending) ■Multiple Endings Alice's actions will slightly affect what ending you get. Once all other endings are obtained, it will unlock an bonus ending.",
