      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "像绘本般的像素世界配合可爱动画，讲述爱丽丝与植物伙伴的小冒险",
      "dimension": "画风",
      "excerpt": "This is the story of Alice and friends' adventure in a pixel-art world that's just like a storybook, told with adorable animations.",
